  "textRawHtml": "<pre><code>def fetch_created_at():\n    conn = pymysql.connect(\n        host=MYSQL_HOST, port=MYSQL_PORT, user=MYSQL_USER,\n        password=MYSQL_PASSWORD, database=MYSQL_DATABASE, charset=\"utf8mb4\",\n    )\n    try:\n        with conn.cursor() as cur:\n            cur.execute(\"SELECT created_at FROM A WHERE uid=%s\", (TARGET_UID,))\n            return [r[0] for r in cur.fetchall()]\n    finally:\n        conn.close()\n</code></pre>\n<p>就是一段读库操作，就涉及 py 的基础操作和上下文管理，PyMySQL 数据库操作。其中数据库操作又涉及 pymysql 的函数作用和事务处理。每一个知识点又能扩展很多内容🤯</p>\n",
